  "body": "Now that [there is not a generic safelist carve-out for all `Sec-`-prefixed request headers](https://github.com/whatwg/fetch/pull/1000), we will need to safelist individual client hints as they become part of the platform.\r\n\r\nI believe the best list of current hints is in [Client Hints Infrastructure](https://wicg.github.io/client-hints-infrastructure/#find-client-hint-value-section). These are at various stages of consensus/maturity; none of them are currently implemented anywhere besides Chrome. Chrome does not preflight when adding any of them.",
